WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
[Original upbeat instrumental music]
RepLock. Move first. Scroll later.

00:04.000 --> 00:10.000
Choose a challenge: squats, jumping jacks, or knee raises.
App screens show illustrative demo data.

00:10.000 --> 00:18.000
Your phone verifies complete reps on-device.
Camera verification is illustrated; footage is not recorded or uploaded.

00:18.000 --> 00:23.000
You did that. Ten squats earn twenty coins.

00:23.000 --> 00:29.000
Ten coins unlock one selected app for five minutes.
The shield returns when your time runs out.

00:29.000 --> 00:35.000
Prefer walking? Five hundred tracked steps earn five coins.
Opt into step tracking, then claim your rewards.

00:35.000 --> 00:40.000
Get up. Get going. RepLock Android early access.
Get the app at the link below. Move comfortably; you stay in control.
